sting/student-500#HowTo" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Department of Home Affairs website</a>.</p> </div>',
    apply_form = 'https://auscanus.edu.au/courses/certificate-iv-in-leadership-and-management/',
    updated_at = NOW()
